- how tracking works: the record format in 1–2 lines;
- whether plugin-eval cases could carry the persistent bench, yes or no and why;
- which option you chose and why, plus the rejected option in one line;
- the files changed;
- the test results, with real output;
- the imported record line;
- the summary output that shows it;
- any open issues.

