- List \`index.md\`, open one note, Grep the name, Read with offset/limit; never Read whole large files such as main/assets/i18n/en.json.
## Entry points
- main/main.ts - application bootstrap
- main/screens/app/app.routes.ts - top-level route table
- main/screens/report/report.routes.ts - report routes
- main/features/risk-management/tasks/tasks.routes.ts - task routes
## Where things live
- Assessment tools: main/features/score-types/<tool>
- Feature flags: main/features/feature-flags
- Guards: main/guards
- HTTP interceptors: main/interceptors
- Route resolvers: main/resolvers
- Screens: main/screens/<screen>
- Services: main/services
- State facades: main/state/*.facade.ts
- Translations: main/assets/i18n/<language>.json
## Naming
- Tool folders: lm-lift, lm-lower, lm-carry, lm-push-pull, niosh, rula-reba, hal, rsi, est, ge-adv, gm-rfc, nom.
- Files: *.component.ts, *.service.ts, *.guard.ts, *.resolver.ts, *.facade.ts, *.routes.ts, *.spec.ts.
## Grep patterns
- Route entries: loadComponent
- Translation key: "<key>": in main/assets/i18n/en.json
