- Written guidelines: CODE_GUIDELINE.md and FF_GUIDELINE.md.
## Errors
- HTTP errors pass through main/interceptors (http-error.interceptor.ts).
## Tests
- Specs sit beside their source as *.spec.ts and run with Vitest (vitest.config.ts).
## Imports
- Route files import guards and resolvers by alias, and relative paths for sibling screens.
